ACKNOWLEDGMENT & AGREEMENT
================================================================================

I acknowledge that I have received, read, and understand Kaira Oasis Care LLC's 
Code of Conduct. I agree to comply with all policies and standards outlined herein.

CORE VALUES & ETHICAL STANDARDS
================================================================================

I commit to upholding the following principles:

☐ Treating all patients and colleagues with dignity and respect
☐ Maintaining confidentiality and HIPAA compliance
☐ Providing compassionate, high-quality patient care
☐ Acting with honesty and integrity in all professional relationships
☐ Following all applicable laws, regulations, and company policies
☐ Reporting violations or misconduct appropriately
☐ Maintaining professional boundaries
☐ Respecting diversity and inclusion

CONDUCT EXPECTATIONS
================================================================================

I understand and agree to:

PATIENT CARE
- Provide competent, compassionate care to all patients
- Respect patient rights, dignity, and autonomy
- Maintain accurate and timely patient records
- Report changes in patient condition immediately
- Advocate for patient needs appropriately

PROFESSIONAL CONDUCT
- Attend work as scheduled and on time
- Maintain professional appearance and hygiene
- Use respectful language in all interactions
- Avoid conflicts of interest
- Support teamwork and collaboration
- Accept constructive feedback professionally

CONFIDENTIALITY & PRIVACY
- Maintain patient confidentiality in all situations
- Use patient information only for approved purposes
- Secure protected health information (PHI)
- Not share patient information on social media
- Report any privacy breaches immediately

SUBSTANCE ABUSE POLICY
- Refrain from using illegal drugs or controlled substances
- Use alcohol responsibly and never while on duty
- Disclose prescription medications affecting job performance
- Comply with all drug testing requirements
- Report substance abuse concerns promptly

HARASSMENT & DISCRIMINATION
- Treat all individuals with respect and dignity
- Not engage in harassment, bullying, or intimidation
- Not discriminate based on protected characteristics
- Report any harassment or discrimination immediately
- Support a safe and inclusive workplace

SAFETY & HEALTH
- Follow all safety procedures and protocols
- Wear appropriate personal protective equipment (PPE)
- Report unsafe conditions or practices
- Maintain proper infection control standards
- Participate in required training and certifications

CONSEQUENCES OF VIOLATIONS
================================================================================

I understand that violations of this Code of Conduct may result in:

☐ Verbal or written warnings
☐ Suspension
☐ Termination of employment
☐ Legal action (if applicable)
☐ Reporting to licensing boards or authorities (if applicable)

The severity of consequences depends on the nature and extent of the violation.

ACKNOWLEDGMENT OF RECEIPT
================================================================================

I certify that:

1. I have received a copy of the Code of Conduct
2. I have read and understand all policies and expectations
3. I have had the opportunity to ask questions
4. I agree to comply with all standards and policies
5. I understand the consequences of non-compliance

I understand that this agreement remains in effect during my employment and 
that policies may be updated. I will be notified of any significant changes.


